WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.080
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:26.080
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.850
Yamate

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:19.100
<i>Dear Yui
 How are you doing?!</i>

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.080
<i>It's been a while since we met in New York.</i>

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.280
<i>The Prince that you met is now a crowned King!</i>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.050
<i>Have you seen it on the news in Japan too?!</i>

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:41.910
Yui! Are you home?!
 I told you to put your shoes away!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:49.490
<i>- A lot has happened since then. </i> 
 - Yui! <i> - A lot.</i>

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.550
Kajika.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:57.800
"The Promised Sky"

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.170
- What's up with the way Lee-Leng is acting! 
 - Oh, Master Tonsen!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:08.060
Don't make a face like that. 
 I'm here to celebrate my nephew's wedding.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.090
He's busy making the preparations.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.420
- Are you trying to keep me from seeing him?! 
 - No, no, it's not like that.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.810
- Zao, you--- 
 - Zao.

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:24.340
Let him through, it's disrespectful.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:30.810
- You finally gave in, huh? I'm not going to let you go today! 
 - I'm not going to be running away from you Uncle.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:35.930
<i>Master Lee-Leng looks like himself!</i>

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:45.870
- I apologize for calling you over all of a sudden. 
 - You didn't let Zao know about this, huh?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.570
- Yes, I haven't told anyone. 
 - What are you planning to do?

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:57.790
I was the only one that wasn't notified about your marriage. I'm an outcast!

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:02.180
I have no intentions of marrying Ling-Lee.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.990
This is for you to believe that I'm speaking the truth.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:13.680
And also, I don't want Zao to listen in on our conversation.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.420
Uncle, your voice is too loud.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:22.030
Can you cooperate with me? 
 Speak a little softer.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:28.240
Uncle, your dreams are to have control of the Huangs. 
 Am I correct?

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:35.090
- You---! 
 - But it's impossible for you to be the leader.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.940
I made sure that it would be that way.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:46.710
- Lee-Leng. 
 - It's possible for your son Fi.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:50.410
- Has Fi become the leader of the Huangs?! 
 - Uncle.

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:56.530
It's not clear now, but if the elders and the affiliated corporations are backing it...

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.400
...I can help organize their support for you.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.440
Lee-Leng you---

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:15.410
- What is it that you wish? 
 - To control Zao's actions.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:22.170
Zao coerced me to stay as the leader of the Huangs in exchange for Kajika's life.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.510
I have no intentions of following that.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:33.220
Can you take out his connections in Hong Kong, Taiwan, Thailand, and Singapore?

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:40.450
I know you will be able to do this Uncle. 
 Even though I'm the leader, I have no such power.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:44.780
For these kinds of things, a long term relationship is the key.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:51.350
You will go to that extent to step down as the leader, just for a woman?!

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:56.220
Wouldn't you like to trust the future in your son's hand?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.870
You'll cooperate with an old enemy to do this?

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:06.000
Not once have I considered you as my enemy.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:10.040
- You're saying that now. 
 - It's true.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:17.020
Even Zao, I consider him as one of my important family members.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:21.480
But, we've gone a little astray.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:28.580
You won't be able to jump ship to the Burnsworths.
 Harry will never cut ties with the Huang Group.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:34.090
- I'm not interested in the Burnsworths. 
 - I just don't get it.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:41.680
Being that young and having lots of potential, you're giving up the highly coveted position as the leader.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:45.690
- I'm honored that you regret me leaving. 
 - Who's regretting it!

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:50.660
I will stop him. You'll break off your engagement and step down as the leader!

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:57.000
But after doing all this I'll never be able to welcome you back as family!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:02.320
- We're at an agreement then. 
 - All right.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:10.410
When you put a knife to me, I was ready to die.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:16.050
Now --- I regret you leaving.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.320
Zao! There's no need for food! I'm going back immediately!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.370
Uncle will be able to take care of this.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.400
We'll see who's quicker, Zao or the elders.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:42.330
If this is a bet I have to put my life on...

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.230
...I wouldn't have to worry about it this much.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.420
<i>But why are you giving up? 
 Why don't you keep fighting?!</i>

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.830
<i>You're the hardest worker on earth!</i>

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.690
I will win this bet!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.870
I will win and I will embrace it in my arms!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.560
I was able to get in contact with Xiao-Ying-san.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:13.510
It seems like Zao-san has planned all of this.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:21.890
- How is Lee-Leng? 
 - Master Carl went to see him. After that he has been eating normally.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.580
Carl? 
 Is that so?

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:33.640
- Carl--- 
 - After that, Master Lee-Leng invited one of the elders, Tonsen-san.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:37.270
I guess Lee-Leng has something planned too.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.780
I won't let it end like this.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:46.860
Now, we're left with how to get Master Lee-Leng out of the estate.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:52.850
The security seems to be tight. 
 It's hard to force our way in with just us.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:57.370
- Leave that task up to me. 
 - Major Noei! - Isaac!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:05.880
- What are you doing here?! 
 His Highness Rumaty ordered me to follow your orders and assist you!

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:11.010
Is that right?! 
 I can't thank you guys enough!

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.800
Say those kinds of things once you get what you want.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.140
My subordinates are ready to move at anytime.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.640
Tomorrow is the new moon! 
 It's perfect for this operation!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.220
Why do we have to go at night?

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.360
I'm just going to get my man back.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:36.140
Let's go in during the daytime, fair and square!

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:44.550
Hey, Yui! 
 Put your shoes away neatly.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:53.150
- It's almost dinner time. 
 - I have no time for that! I have to get it back! Whatever it takes!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.990
Get what?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:01.470
He's taking it back?! 
 There's no way! It must be a mistake!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:07.550
- What kind of joke is this?! 
 - Father?

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:14.780
- What happened? 
 - Tonsen has nominated his son, Fi instead of Lee-Leng as the leader!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:20.670
There's no way Uncle Tonsen would do something so selfish!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:26.760
But, Lee-Leng has agreed to this and he's going to break the engagement with you...

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:33.190
...he's also saying that he'll cut ties with the family too. 
 - It's a lie! It's definitely a lie!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:40.140
Not only do the elders know about this, but all the groups under the Huang Group know about it!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.310
There's also a rally for Fi's support.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:51.160
If this is true, then all the elders are going to follow Tonsen's command.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.500
I will be the laughing stock.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:57.020
Brother---

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.940
I am going to go check right now!

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:17.560
- Don't joke around with me. 
 - Brother! Where are you?

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.480
- Master Ling-Lee. 
 - Zao! Dissolution of our engagement?!

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:25.310
You have nothing to worry about, it's just a bad rumor.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:29.100
I'm impressed, Uncle Tonsen is quick.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.650
Brother?

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:41.420
You know Che Hen Chi from Indonesia well, right?

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:48.180
He's one of the most trusted young presidents among our group. 
 I asked for his cooperation...

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:51.590
...to support Fi.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:12:00.500
Ling-Lee, our marriage is arranged only in order to strengthen our family.

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:07.580
If you're not in agreement with those terms, there's no marriage more unfortunate than this one.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:13.950
Strengthen the family? 
 So, you just---

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:19.360
Master Lee-Leng, don't make me say the same thing again.

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:27.710
You can no longer call your hitmen. 
 Uncle Tonsen has been an elder for quite some time.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:34.940
- You joined hands with Master Tonsen?! 
 - This was the only option I had to save Kajika from you.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:41.500
Zao, I love you.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.160
You were my most trustworthy subordinate in the family.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:50.230
You loved me the most too.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:56.950
I'm regretful that it turned out like this.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:02.140
Fi is inferior but perfect for this generation.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:08.350
He won't destroy the ties that I have made.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:15.780
- The Huangs will stop here then! 
 - That's alright. If it gets too big all of a sudden, there will be repercussions for that.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:21.800
Zao, you're very extreme and you don't know how to hold off.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.910
That's why you want a "head" to follow.

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:32.310
I wanted to be your "head", but that's no longer possible.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.330
There are replacements for the "head" of the Huangs.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:40.340
Kajika and I. 
 We're irreplaceable.

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:44.250
Master Lee-Leng, it's not that simple.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:50.850
Even if it was Master Tonsen, do you think he'll be able to pull the strings on everything?

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:55.720
It's not too late yet! 
 Tell the elders you take back what you said!

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:59.130
We'll see...

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:01.870
Brother!

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:06.260
Until the elders decide what to do with me...

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:11.010
I'm going to have you wait here quietly.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:17.600
- I can still call people. 
 - I'm still the master of this house.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.430
- The subordinates will be confused. 
 - Master Lee-Leng.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:28.880
You told me to be prepared for any situation.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:34.040
There are people that I personally hired on this estate.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.530
Charlie! 
 Joey!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.600
Don't you move!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:45.190
Charlie and Joey are taking a nap outside!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:50.480
- Who are you guys?!
 - Lee-Leng, put your gun down!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:56.180
- Is that voice--- Noei?! 
 - Don't rely on the people outside.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:15:00.740
- You'll get hurt. 
 - We secured the inside. Make a way for us to get out.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:25.770
Are you surprised? 
 Now watch this.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.600
Could this be?!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.410
Lee-Leng!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:38.100
Kajika?!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.610
Choose whether you're going to come or stay here! Right now!

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:55.270
If you're going to come with me, I'll put my life on the line!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:01.930
<i>You, you're such a princess.</i>

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.710
<i>So, selfish and aggressive.</i>

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:13.300
<i>I liked that and chose you, from twelve years ago.</i>

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:23.680
Brother! I'm breaking off our engagement! 
 You're not fit as the leader!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:28.880
I want to marry the leader of the Huangs!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.700
I'm not interested in just you!

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.880
Go wherever you want to go to!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.430
Thanks, Ling-Lee.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.220
Master Lee-Leng!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:19.970
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:24.480
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:29.440
I'll take off and break all the way

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:00.840
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:05.620
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:10.270
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:14.820
I'll take off and break all the way

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:19.350
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:23.930
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:28.140
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:33.230
I know I can change all the way

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:33.230
- Lee-Leng! 
 - Kajika!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:37.260
For the moment...

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:39.060
I got you. I won't let you go.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:42.970
I just wanna hold you...

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.430
You're mine!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.630
I won't let anyone else have you.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:56.760
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:18:58.210 --> 00:19:01.680
I learned about this later from Isaac but...

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.860
- Are you going after him? 
- I took my chances.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:12.700
I have no business with the Huangs now. 
 I'll go find another "head."

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:16.330
Were you really going to kill Master Kajika?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:21.840
Maybe. Maybe not.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:24.930
It doesn't matter now.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:32.550
- You guys did quite the damage. 
 - Send the invoices to Rosenthal.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.660
Where do you want to head to now?!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.160
We have a plane ready for you at the airport.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.190
I want to go to Givoli! Maria will be waiting!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:47.390
Givoli Island huh? 
 I always wanted to go there.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:53.280
- You're coming too? 
 - You can get off if you have a problem.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:59.500
- This is my helicopter. 
 - I have a helicopter too!

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:04.340
Wow! How great! I'm going to have Mustafa and Lee-Leng on Givoli!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:10.200
But, can you stop by Raginei before that? 
 I want Grandpa to meet Lee-Leng!

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:14.340
- His Highness Machaty, huh? 
 - He's not doing well.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:17.560
He gave me a lot of courage.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:21.790
- He encouraged me. 
 - What did he say?

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:28.040
He told me to fall in love. 
To dedicate a lifetime to it.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:34.980
<i>I'll be there soon, along with my husband.</i>

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:43.170
- Kathleen. 
 - Your Highness, are you awake?

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:49.160
- Is he just mumbling? 
 - Maybe not, call in His Highness.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:52.310
- Get Master Fred and Master Harry too. 
 - Yes, sir!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.960
Kathleen!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:03.970
- It seems like you're uncomfortable. 
 - Yea, I'm not quite used to it.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:08.140
I don't know if I'm unkind but it's not really hitting me.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:14.740
When I was seven, Grandfather was already the Throne of God.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:21.070
Kajika will be back shortly.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:28.530
- Let's have dinner together with Lee-Leng. 
 - Wow, Uncle, you're so confident.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:34.640
- There's nothing to worry about, it's Kajika. 
 - I think so too.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:42.610
But--- I have a broken heart. 
 I thought I'd match well with Kajika.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:49.970
You'll find a perfect one soon, Your Highness. 
 A lover and not a friend this time.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.470
If you would like, I can introduce you to some people.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:57.520
Are you planning to start a game with me now?

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:03.150
- That might be a good idea. 
 - Your Highness! Master Harry!

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.740
<i>Listen to me my beloved children.</i>

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:21.790
<i>It is the best days of your life to love someone.</i>

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:25.480
Let's go inside now, Father.

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:32.400
<i>You should enjoy these days to the fullest.</i>

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:35.900
A voice?

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:40.840
<i>When that time comes.</i>

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:47.810
When that time comes, you should not hesitate.

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:20.640
What's up Kajika?

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:28.480
I was listening to the sound of the waves.
